abstract: >-
  Open bilingual (English and Turkish) materials of an eleven-week training
  program on artificial intelligence with Python for cardiologists and other
  specialist physicians, prepared for the Turkish Society of Cardiology. Each
  week combines a clinical case, a lecture page, an interactive lab, a Jupyter
  notebook with Python basics, ready prompts and a ready application at every
  practice stop, and a weekly project, built around a virtual cardiology
  clinic of synthetic patients and real public data.
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - machine learning
